    "result_text": "The full suite passes. `AcceptanceTest` is the only test class with `@Test` methods (the other two are the base class and a helper), and both of its tests are green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `membershipTier` rule: **`SILVER`** when `namesakeCount` is 0 and an email is present, otherwise **`BRONZE`**.\n\nChanges:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `membershipTier` string property (enum `SILVER`/`BRONZE`) to the `Owner` schema so it is part of the generated `OwnerDto` and serialized on reads.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `toMembershipTier` mapping (following the existing `displayName`/`initials`/`membershipNumber` derived-field pattern) that returns `SILVER` when the owner has `namesakeCount == 0` and a non-blank email, otherwise `BRONZE`.\n\nThe derived value flows through the existing `GET /api/owners/{id}` path via the mapper, so both acceptance tests (`coreSilverWhenUniqueWithEmail`, `functionalityBronzeWhenNoEmail`) and the full suite pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 2/2 tests green).",
